  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAZINGIRA ALLIANCE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support civic education, peacebuilding, and youth engagement in underserved Mandera County through training 30 Civic Peace champions, hosting 6 community dialogue forums, and developing civic education toolkits in Somali and Borana ethnic languages. Mazingira Alliance is uniquely placed to implement this project because of its ability to work with hard to reach communities via its alliance set-up. 
The project is targeting the furthest behind in a fragile county with limited international investment. GoK and development partners such as the UN often exclude Mandera in civic engagement programming and political outreach. 
The Programme Coordinator for this project sits on the EU Youth Sounding Board and the concept is based on research he did on predictors of youth engagement in electoral processes in Kenya.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
